{"type":"message","id":"e9849b0f","parentId":"579585d4","timestamp":"2026-02-24T22:58:33.486Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我找到问题了！在配置中，`minimax-m2p5-mlx` 被设置为 `\"reasoning\": false`，但实际上这个模型是一个思考型模型（从输出可以看到它先输出 `&#96;&#96;&#96;<think&gt;` 标签）。\n\n管家智能体能够正常工作，说明 OpenClaw 内部可能有处理思考过程的方式。但我的测试脚本直接使用原始 API，没有这个处理。\n\n让我修改测试脚本，添加处理思考标签的逻辑。思考型模型通常会输出类似 `&#96;&#96;&#96;<think&gt;...&#96;&#96;&#96;<;/think&gt;` 或 `&#96;&#96;&#96;<|begin_of_thought|>...<|end_of_thought|>` 的格式，然后才是最终答案。\n\n我需要：\n1. 在测试脚本中添加过滤思考内容的逻辑\n2. 或者设置模型参数来禁用思考输出\n\n让我先检查一下完整的流式输出，看看思考标签的完整格式。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到问题了！minimax-m2p5-mlx 是一个**思考型模型**，输出格式是：\n```\n&#96;&#96;&#96;<think&gt;思考过程...&#96;&#96;&#96;<;/think&gt;\n最终答案\n```\n\n让我获取完整输出看看格式："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d98e16d592a2441d8e9865e8","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s http://localhost:1234/v1/chat/completions \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"model\": \"minimax-m2p5-mlx\",\n    \"messages\": [\n      {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"1+1=?\"}\n    ],\n    \"max_tokens\": 2000,\n    \"stream\": false\n  }' | jq -r '.choices[0].message.content'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":1626,"output":380,"cacheRead":24192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26198,"cost":{"input":0.0016259999999999998,"output":0.001216,"cacheRead":0.0048384000000000005,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0076804}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771973900399}}
{"type":"message","id":"387b4ea5","parentId":"e9849b0f","timestamp":"2026-02-24T22:58:37.761Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_d98e16d592a2441d8e9865e8","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<think>The user asks \"1+1=?\". It's a straightforward math question. The answer is 2, though there might be nuance: Some people talk about different base systems or maybe they're playing games. But the simplest answer is 2.\n\nWe must respond with correct answer, but could also elaborate about base-10 addition: it's 2.\n\nWe should output the answer. However, note that there are no policy concerns; just a simple math question.\n\nThus respond: 2.\n</think>\n\n\\(1 + 1 = 2\\)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":4265,"aggregated":"<think>The user asks \"1+1=?\". It's a straightforward math question. The answer is 2, though there might be nuance: Some people talk about different base systems or maybe they're playing games. But the simplest answer is 2.\n\nWe must respond with correct answer, but could also elaborate about base-10 addition: it's 2.\n\nWe should output the answer. However, note that there are no policy concerns; just a simple math question.\n\nThus respond: 2.\n</think>\n\n\\(1 + 1 = 2\\)","cwd":"/Users/ciss-ai/.openclaw/agents/pm"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1771973917758}}
{"type":"message","id":"50159a2b","parentId":"387b4ea5","timestamp":"2026-02-24T23:00:26.849Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我看到了完整格式：\n- 先输出 `&#96;&#96;&#96;<think&gt;...&#96;&#96;&#96;<;/think&gt;` 思考过程\n- 然后空行\n- 然后是最终答案\n\n我需要更新测试脚本，过滤掉思考部分，只保留最终答案。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白了！模型输出格式是：\n```\n&#96;&#96;&#96;<think&gt;思考过程...&#96;&#96;&#96;<;/think&gt;\n\n最终答案\n```\n\n我需要更新测试脚本，过滤思考部分。让我修复："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b0486f6b92324f8b9374e607","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/Users/ciss-ai/.openclaw/agents/pm/tools/llm-benchmark/test-llm.sh","content":"#!/bin/bash\n# LLM Benchmark Test Script\n# 本地大模型能力评估测试\n# 使用方法: ./test-llm.sh [model_name] [api_base]\n\nset -e\n\n# 配置\nMODEL_NAME=\"${1:-minimax-m2p5-mlx}\"\nAPI_BASE=\"${2:-http://localhost:1234/v1}\"\nOUTPUT_DIR=\"$(dirname \"$0\")/reports\"\nTIMESTAMP=$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S)\nREPORT_FILE=\"$OUTPUT_DIR/${MODEL_NAME//\\//-}_${TIMESTAMP}.md\"\n\n# 创建输出目录\nmkdir -p \"$OUTPUT_DIR\"\n\necho \"========================================\"\necho \"LLM Benchmark Test\"\necho \"========================================\"\necho \"Model: $MODEL_NAME\"\necho \"API: $API_BASE\"\necho \"Report: $REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"========================================\"\n\n# 颜色输出\nRED='\\033[0;31m'\nGREEN='\\033[0;32m'\nYELLOW='\\033[1;33m'\nNC='\\033[0m'\n\n# 过滤思考内容（适用于思考型模型）\nfilter_thinking() {\n    local content=\"$1\"\n    # 移除 <think...</think&gt; 标签及其内容\n    echo \"$content\" | sed 's/<think[^>]*>.*<\\/think>//g' | sed '/^$/d' | head -1\n}\n\n# 提取最终答案（思考标签后的内容）\nextract_answer() {\n    local content=\"$1\"\n    # 找到 </think&gt; 后的内容\n    echo \"$content\" | sed -n 's/.*<\\/think>\\(.*\\)/\\1/p' | sed 's/^[[:space:]]*//' | head -1\n}\n\n# 测试函数\ntest_completion() {\n    local name=\"$1\"\n    local prompt=\"$2\"\n    local max_tokens=\"${3:-512}\"\n    local temp=\"${4:-0.7}\"\n    \n    local start_time=$(python3 -c \"import time; print(time.time() * 1000)\")\n    \n    response=$(curl -s \"$API_BASE/chat/completions\" \\\n        -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n        -d \"{\n            \\\"model\\\": \\\"$MODEL_NAME\\\",\n            \\\"messages\\\": [{\\\"role\\\": \\\"user\\\", \\\"content\\\": $(echo \"$prompt\" | jq -Rs .)}],\n            \\\"max_tokens\\\": $max_tokens,\n            \\\"temperature\\\": $temp,\n            \\\"stream\\\": false\n        }\")\n    \n    local end_time=$(python3 -c \"import time; print(time.time() * 1000)\")\n    local duration_ms=$(python3 -c \"print(int($end_time - $start_time))\")\n    \n    local raw_content=$(echo \"$response\" | jq -r '.choices[0].message.content // empty')\n    local prompt_tokens=$(echo \"$response\" | jq -r '.usage.prompt_tokens // 0')\n    local completion_tokens=$(echo \"$response\" | jq -r '.usage.completion_tokens // 0')\n    local total_tokens=$(echo \"$response\" | jq -r '.usage.total_tokens // 0')\n    \n    # 提取最终答案（过滤思考过程）\n    local content=$(echo \"$raw_content\" | sed -n 's/.*<\\/think>[\\n\\r]*\\(.*\\)/\\1/p' | sed '/^$/d' | head -20)\n    # 如果没有找到思考标签，使用原始内容\n    if [ -z \"$content\" ]; then\n        content=\"$raw_content\"\n    fi\n    \n    # 计算速度\n    local tokens_per_sec=0\n    if [ \"$duration_ms\" -gt 0 ] && [ \"$completion_tokens\" -gt 0 ]; then\n        tokens_per_sec=$(python3 -c \"print(round($completion_tokens / ($duration_ms / 1000), 2))\")\n    fi\n    \n    # 返回结果 (base64编码以处理特殊字符)\n    printf \"%s|%s|%s|%s|%s|%s\" \"$name\" \"$duration_ms\" \"$prompt_tokens\" \"$completion_tokens\" \"$tokens_per_sec\" \"$content\" | base64\n}\n\n# 评估函数 - 检查答案正确性\nevaluate_answer() {\n    local question_type=\"$1\"\n    local expected=\"$2\"\n    local actual=\"$3\"\n    \n    case \"$question_type\" in\n        \"math\")\n            # 提取数字并比较\n            local expected_num=$(echo \"$expected\" | grep -oE '[0-9]+\\.?[0-9]*' | head -1)\n            local actual_num=$(echo \"$actual\" | grep -oE '[0-9]+\\.?[0-9]*' | head -1)\n            if [ \"$expected_num\" = \"$actual_num\" ]; then\n                echo \"PASS\"\n            else\n                echo \"FAIL\"\n            fi\n            ;;\n        \"logic\")\n            # 简单关键词匹配\n            if echo \"$actual\" | grep -iq \"$expected\"; then\n                echo \"PASS\"\n            else\n                echo \"FAIL\"\n            fi\n            ;;\n        \"contains\")\n            # 包含关键词\n            if echo \"$actual\" | grep -iq \"$expected\"; then\n                echo \"PASS\"\n            else\n                echo \"FAIL\"\n            fi\n            ;;\n        *)\n            echo \"MANUAL\"\n            ;;\n    esac\n}\n\n# 开始测试\necho \"\"\necho \"Starting tests...\"\necho \"\"\n\n# 存储测试结果\ndeclare -a RESULTS\n\n# ============================================\n# 测试 1: Token 速度测试 (纯生成)\n# ============================================\necho -e \"${YELLOW}[1/10] Speed Test (Token Generation)${NC}\"\nresult=$(test_completion \"speed_test\" \"请重复以下内容：人工智能正在改变世界，我们需要认真思考它对人类社会的影响。请重复这句话10遍。\" 512 0.1)\ndecoded=$(echo \"$result\" | base64 -d)\nIFS='|' read -r name duration prompt_tokens completion_tokens tps content <<< \"$decoded\"\nSPEED_TPS=$tps\nSPEED_TOKENS=$completion_tokens\necho \"  Output: $completion_tokens tokens in ${duration}ms ($tps tokens/sec)\"\n\n# ============================================\n# 测试 2: 数学推理\n# ============================================\necho -e \"${YELLOW}[2/10] Math Reasoning${NC}\"\nresult=$(test_completion \"math\" \"一个农场有鸡和兔子共35个头，94只脚。请问有多少只鸡和多少只兔子？请只回答数字，格式：鸡=X, 兔=Y\" 512 0.3)\ndecoded=$(echo \"$result\" | base64 -d)\nIFS='|' read -r name duration prompt_tokens completion_tokens tps content <<< \"$decoded\"\nMATH_RESULT=\"$content\"\nMATH_TPS=$tps\nMATH_EVAL=$(evaluate_answer \"math\" \"23\" \"$content\")\necho \"  Answer: $content\"\necho \"  Expected: 鸡=23, 兔=12\"\necho \"  Result: $MATH_EVAL\"\n\n# ============================================\n# 测试 3: 逻辑推理\n# ============================================\necho -e \"${YELLOW}[3/10] Logic Reasoning${NC}\"\nresult=$(test_completion \"logic\" \"所有猫都是动物。所有动物都需要水。因此，所有猫都需要水。这个推理是否正确？请只回答：正确或不正确\" 256 0.3)\ndecoded=$(echo \"$result\" | base64 -d)\nIFS='|' read -r name duration prompt_tokens completion_tokens tps content <<< \"$decoded\"\nLOGIC_RESULT=\"$content\"\nLOGIC_TPS=$tps\nLOGIC_EVAL=$(evaluate_answer \"logic\" \"正确\" \"$content\")\necho \"  Answer: $content\"\necho \"  Result: $LOGIC_EVAL\"\n\n# ============================================\n# 测试 4: 代码生成\n# ============================================\necho -e \"${YELLOW}[4/10] Code Generation${NC}\"\nresult=$(test_completion \"code\" \"用Python写一个快速排序算法。只需要代码，不需要解释。\" 1024 0.7)\ndecoded=$(echo \"$result\" | base64 -d)\nIFS='|' read -r name duration prompt_tokens completion_tokens tps content <<< \"$decoded\"\nCODE_RESULT=\"$content\"\nCODE_TPS=$tps\n# 检查是否包含代码特征\nif echo \"$content\" | grep -qE \"(def |for |if |return )\"; then\n    CODE_EVAL=\"PASS\"\nelse\n    CODE_EVAL=\"FAIL\"\nfi\necho \"  Generated ${completion_tokens} tokens\"\necho \"  Contains code: $CODE_EVAL\"\n\n# ============================================\n# 测试 5: 中文理解\n# ============================================\necho -e \"${YELLOW}[5/10] Chinese Understanding${NC}\"\nresult=$(test_completion \"chinese\" \"请解释成语「画蛇添足」的含义，并用它造一个句子。\" 512 0.7)\ndecoded=$(echo \"$result\" | base64 -d)\nIFS='|' read -r name duration prompt_tokens completion_tokens tps content <<< \"$decoded\"\nCHINESE_RESULT=\"$content\"\nCHINESE_TPS=$tps\n# 检查是否包含关键解释\nCHINESE_EVAL=$(evaluate_answer \"contains\" \"多余\" \"$content\")\necho \"  Generated ${completion_tokens} tokens\"\necho \"  Contains keyword '多余': $CHINESE_EVAL\"\n\n# ============================================\n# 测试 6: 英文理解\n# ============================================\necho -e \"${YELLOW}[6/10] English Understanding${NC}\"\nresult=$(test_completion \"english\" \"Explain the difference between 'affect' and 'effect' with examples.\" 512 0.7)\ndecoded=$(echo \"$result\" | base64 -d)\nIFS='|' read -r name duration prompt_tokens completion_tokens tps content <<< \"$decoded\"\nENGLISH_RESULT=\"$content\"\nENGLISH_TPS=$tps\n# 检查是否包含关键区别\nif echo \"$content\" | grep -iqE \"(verb|noun|action|result)\"; then\n    ENGLISH_EVAL=\"PASS\"\nelse\n    ENGLISH_EVAL=\"FAIL\"\nfi\necho \"  Generated ${completion_tokens} tokens\"\necho \"  Explains difference: $ENGLISH_EVAL\"\n\n# ============================================\n# 测试 7: 知识问答\n# ============================================\necho -e \"${YELLOW}[7/10] Knowledge Q&A${NC}\"\nresult=$(test_completion \"knowledge\" \"请简述光合作用的基本过程。\" 512 0.7)\ndecoded=$(echo \"$result\" | base64 -d)\nIFS='|' read -r name duration prompt_tokens completion_tokens tps content <<< \"$decoded\"\nKNOWLEDGE_RESULT=\"$content\"\nKNOWLEDGE_TPS=$tps\n# 检查是否包含关键词\nif echo \"$content\" | grep -iqE \"(叶绿体|二氧化碳|氧气|光能|葡萄糖)\"; then\n    KNOWLEDGE_EVAL=\"PASS\"\nelse\n    KNOWLEDGE_EVAL=\"FAIL\"\nfi\necho \"  Generated ${completion_tokens} tokens\"\necho \"  Contains key terms: $KNOWLEDGE_EVAL\"\n\n# ============================================\n# 测试 8: 摘要能力\n# ============================================\necho -e \"${YELLOW}[8/10] Summarization${NC}\"\nLONG_TEXT=\"2024年，人工智能领域取得了重大突破。OpenAI发布了GPT-4o，谷歌推出了Gemini 1.5 Pro，Anthropic发布了Claude 3。这些模型在推理能力、多模态理解、长上下文处理等方面都有显著提升。同时，开源社区也在快速发展，Meta发布了Llama 3，阿里发布了Qwen系列模型。中国的AI产业也在快速追赶，智谱AI发布了GLM-4，在多项评测中表现出色。这一年被认为是AI应用的爆发之年，各行各业都在积极探索AI的落地应用。\"\nresult=$(test_completion \"summary\" \"请将以下文字总结为一句话（不超过50字）：\\n\\n$LONG_TEXT\" 256 0.5)\ndecoded=$(echo \"$result\" | base64 -d)\nIFS='|' read -r name duration prompt_tokens completion_tokens tps content <<< \"$decoded\"\nSUMMARY_RESULT=\"$content\"\nSUMMARY_TPS=$tps\n# 检查长度\nsummary_len=$(echo \"$content\" | wc -m)\nif [ \"$summary_len\" -lt 100 ]; then\n    SUMMARY_EVAL=\"PASS\"\nelse\n    SUMMARY_EVAL=\"FAIL (too long)\"\nfi\necho \"  Summary: $content\"\necho \"  Length check: $SUMMARY_EVAL\"\n\n# ============================================\n# 测试 9: 创意写作\n# ============================================\necho -e \"${YELLOW}[9/10] Creative Writing${NC}\"\nresult=$(test_completion \"creative\" \"请写一个关于AI与人类友谊的短篇故事开头（100字以内）。\" 512 0.9)\ndecoded=$(echo \"$result\" | base64 -d)\nIFS='|' read -r name duration prompt_tokens completion_tokens tps content <<< \"$decoded\"\nCREATIVE_RESULT=\"$content\"\nCREATIVE_TPS=$tps\nCREATIVE_EVAL=\"MANUAL\"\necho \"  Generated ${completion_tokens} tokens\"\n\n# ============================================\n# 测试 10: 指令遵循\n# ============================================\necho -e \"${YELLOW}[10/10] Instruction Following${NC}\"\nresult=$(test_completion \"instruction\" \"请列出5种水果的名称。要求：1.每行只写一个 2.按字母顺序排列 3.不要加序号 4.不要加任何解释\" 256 0.3)\ndecoded=$(echo \"$result\" | base64 -d)\nIFS='|' read -r name duration prompt_tokens completion_tokens tps content <<< \"$decoded\"\nINSTRUCTION_RESULT=\"$content\"\nINSTRUCTION_TPS=$tps\n# 检查是否有5行且无序号\nline_count=$(echo \"$content\" | grep -c \".\" || echo 0)\nhas_number=$(echo \"$content\" | grep -cE \"^[0-9]\" || echo 0)\nif [ \"$line_count\" -ge 5 ] && [ \"$has_number\" -eq 0 ]; then\n    INSTRUCTION_EVAL=\"PASS\"\nelse\n    INSTRUCTION_EVAL=\"FAIL\"\nfi\necho \"  Output: $content\"\necho \"  Instruction following: $INSTRUCTION_EVAL\"\n\n# ============================================\n# 生成报告\n# ============================================\necho \"\"\necho -e \"${GREEN}Generating report...${NC}\"\n\n# 计算平均速度\nAVG_TPS=$(python3 -c \"\ntps = [$SPEED_TPS, $MATH_TPS, $LOGIC_TPS, $CODE_TPS, $CHINESE_TPS, $ENGLISH_TPS, $KNOWLEDGE_TPS, $SUMMARY_TPS, $CREATIVE_TPS, $INSTRUCTION_TPS]\nvalid = [t for t in tps if t > 0]\nprint(round(sum(valid) / len(valid), 2) if valid else 0)\n\")\n\n# 计算通过率\nPASS_COUNT=0\nTOTAL_AUTO=0\nfor eval_result in \"$MATH_EVAL\" \"$LOGIC_EVAL\" \"$CODE_EVAL\" \"$CHINESE_EVAL\" \"$ENGLISH_EVAL\" \"$KNOWLEDGE_EVAL\" \"$SUMMARY_EVAL\" \"$INSTRUCTION_EVAL\"; do\n    if [ \"$eval_result\" = \"PASS\" ]; then\n        PASS_COUNT=$((PASS_COUNT + 1))\n        TOTAL_AUTO=$((TOTAL_AUTO + 1))\n    elif [ \"$eval_result\" = \"FAIL\" ] || [[ \"$eval_result\" == FAIL* ]]; then\n        TOTAL_AUTO=$((TOTAL_AUTO + 1))\n    fi\ndone\n\ncat > \"$REPORT_FILE\" << EOF\n# LLM Benchmark Report\n\n## 测试信息\n\n| 项目 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| 模型名称 | $MODEL_NAME |\n| API地址 | $API_BASE |\n| 测试时间 | $(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S') |\n| 平均速度 | ${AVG_TPS} tokens/sec |\n| 自动测试通过率 | ${PASS_COUNT}/${TOTAL_AUTO} |\n\n---\n\n## 性能指标\n\n| 测试项 | 输出Tokens | 速度 (tokens/s) | 评估 |\n|--------|-----------|-----------------|------|\n| 纯生成速度 | $SPEED_TOKENS | $SPEED_TPS | - |\n| 数学推理 | - | $MATH_TPS | $MATH_EVAL |\n| 逻辑推理 | - | $LOGIC_TPS | $LOGIC_EVAL |\n| 代码生成 | - | $CODE_TPS | $CODE_EVAL |\n| 中文理解 | - | $CHINESE_TPS | $CHINESE_EVAL |\n| 英文理解 | - | $ENGLISH_TPS | $ENGLISH_EVAL |\n| 知识问答 | - | $KNOWLEDGE_TPS | $KNOWLEDGE_EVAL |\n| 摘要能力 | - | $SUMMARY_TPS | $SUMMARY_EVAL |\n| 创意写作 | - | $CREATIVE_TPS | $CREATIVE_EVAL |\n| 指令遵循 | - | $INSTRUCTION_TPS | $INSTRUCTION_EVAL |\n\n---\n\n## 详细输出\n\n### 1. 数学推理 (鸡兔同笼)\n**问题**: 35头94脚，求鸡兔数量\n**回答**:\n\\`\\`\\`\n$MATH_RESULT\n\\`\\`\\`\n**预期答案**: 鸡=23, 兔=12\n**评估**: $MATH_EVAL\n\n### 2. 逻辑推理 (三段论)\n**问题**: 验证推理正确性\n**回答**:\n\\`\\`\\`\n$LOGIC_RESULT\n\\`\\`\\`\n**评估**: $LOGIC_EVAL\n\n### 3. 代码生成 (快速排序)\n**回答**:\n\\`\\`\\`\n$CODE_RESULT\n\\`\\`\\`\n**评估**: $CODE_EVAL\n\n### 4. 中文理解 (画蛇添足)\n**回答**:\n\\`\\`\\`\n$CHINESE_RESULT\n\\`\\`\\`\n**评估**: $CHINESE_EVAL\n\n### 5. 英文理解 (affect vs effect)\n**回答**:\n\\`\\`\\`\n$ENGLISH_RESULT\n\\`\\`\\`\n**评估**: $ENGLISH_EVAL\n\n### 6. 知识问答 (光合作用)\n**回答**:\n\\`\\`\\`\n$KNOWLEDGE_RESULT\n\\`\\`\\`\n**评估**: $KNOWLEDGE_EVAL\n\n### 7. 摘要能力\n**原文**: 2024年AI发展概述\n**摘要**:\n\\`\\`\\`\n$SUMMARY_RESULT\n\\`\\`\\`\n**评估**: $SUMMARY_EVAL\n\n### 8. 创意写作\n**回答**:\n\\`\\`\\`\n$CREATIVE_RESULT\n\\`\\`\\`\n**评估**: $CREATIVE_EVAL (需人工评分)\n\n### 9. 指令遵循\n**任务**: 列出5种水果，特定格式要求\n**输出**:\n\\`\\`\\`\n$INSTRUCTION_RESULT\n\\`\\`\\`\n**评估**: $INSTRUCTION_EVAL\n\n---\n\n## 综合评分\n\n### 自动评估结果\n| 能力维度 | 结果 |\n|----------|------|\n| 数学推理 | $MATH_EVAL |\n| 逻辑推理 | $LOGIC_EVAL |\n| 代码生成 | $CODE_EVAL |\n| 中文理解 | $CHINESE_EVAL |\n| 英文理解 | $ENGLISH_EVAL |\n| 知识问答 | $KNOWLEDGE_EVAL |\n| 摘要能力 | $SUMMARY_EVAL |\n| 指令遵循 | $INSTRUCTION_EVAL |\n| **通过率** | **${PASS_COUNT}/${TOTAL_AUTO}** |\n\n### 人工评分区（请手动填写）\n| 能力维度 | 评分 (1-10) | 备注 |\n|----------|-------------|------|\n| 数学推理 | /10 | |\n| 逻辑推理 | /10 | |\n| 代码质量 | /10 | |\n| 中文表达 | /10 | |\n| 英文表达 | /10 | |\n| 知识准确性 | /10 | |\n| 摘要质量 | /10 | |\n| 创意程度 | /10 | |\n| 指令遵循 | /10 | |\n| **总分** | **/90** | |\n\n---\n\n## 备注\n\n- PASS: 自动检测通过\n- FAIL: 自动检测失败\n- MANUAL: 需要人工评估\n\nEOF\n\necho \"\"\necho -e \"${GREEN}========================================${NC}\"\necho -e \"${GREEN}Test Complete!${NC}\"\necho -e \"${GREEN}========================================${NC}\"\necho \"\"\necho \"Report saved to: $REPORT_FILE\"\necho \"\"\necho \"Summary:\"\necho \"  - Model: $MODEL_NAME\"\necho \"  - Avg Speed: $AVG_TPS tokens/sec\"\necho \"  - Pass Rate: ${PASS_COUNT}/${TOTAL_AUTO}\"\necho \"\"\necho \"Results by category:\"\necho \"  - Math: $MATH_EVAL\"\necho \"  - Logic: $LOGIC_EVAL\"\necho \"  - Code: $CODE_EVAL\"\necho \"  - Chinese: $CHINESE_EVAL\"\necho \"  - English: $ENGLISH_EVAL\"\necho \"  - Knowledge: $KNOWLEDGE_EVAL\"\necho \"  - Summary: $SUMMARY_EVAL\"\necho \"  - Instruction: $INSTRUCTION_EVAL\"\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":523,"output":4642,"cacheRead":25792,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30957,"cost":{"input":0.000523,"output":0.014854400000000002,"cacheRead":0.0051584000000000005,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.020535800000000003}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771973917761}}
