{"type":"message","id":"fb7fa181","parentId":"f42bf3ff","timestamp":"2026-02-25T12:27:18.922Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"如我所料，mount 命令需要 root 权限。在 macOS 上，普通用户无法执行 mount 命令。\n\n有几个解决方案：\n\n1. **使用 sudo + LaunchDaemon**：把 plist 放到 /Library/LaunchDaemons/ 下，以 root 身份运行\n2. **配置 sudoers 免密码**：允许用户无密码执行 mount 命令\n3. **使用 macOS 的 automount**：通过 /etc/auto_master 和 /etc/auto_nfs 配置\n\n最佳方案是使用 LaunchDaemon。让我更新配置。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"`mount` 命令需要 root 权限。需要改用 **LaunchDaemon**（以 root 身份运行）。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8c268c61d7eb474297e9f53c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 更新 plist，添加为 LaunchDaemon\ncat > /tmp/com.user.mount-nfs.plist << 'EOF'\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC \"-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN\" \"http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd\">\n<plist version=\"1.0\">\n<dict>\n    <key>Label</key>\n    <string>com.user.mount-nfs</string>\n    <key>ProgramArguments</key>\n    <array>\n        <string>/Users/ciss-ai/scripts/mount-nfs.sh</string>\n    </array>\n    <key>RunAtLoad</key>\n    <true/>\n    <key>StandardOutPath</key>\n    <string>/tmp/mount-nfs.out</string>\n    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>\n    <string>/tmp/mount-nfs.err</string>\n</dict>\n</plist>\nEOF\necho \"plist 已创建在 /tmp\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":132,"output":371,"cacheRead":42752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43255,"cost":{"input":0.00013199999999999998,"output":0.0011872,"cacheRead":0.008550400000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.009869600000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772022424356}}
