{"type":"message","id":"b618e86d","parentId":"9416d62d","timestamp":"2026-02-25T12:27:37.891Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在需要：\n1. 卸载之前的 LaunchAgent\n2. 将 plist 复制到 /Library/LaunchDaemons/（需要 sudo）\n3. 加载 LaunchDaemon\n\n需要用户执行 sudo 命令。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"需要 sudo 权限来完成剩余步骤。请在终端执行以下命令：\n\n```bash\n# 1. 卸载之前的 LaunchAgent\nlaunchctl unload ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.user.mount-nfs.plist 2>/dev/null\nrm ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.user.mount-nfs.plist\n\n# 2. 安装为 LaunchDaemon（需要 sudo）\nsudo cp /tmp/com.user.mount-nfs.plist /Library/LaunchDaemons/\nsudo chown root:wheel /Library/LaunchDaemons/com.user.mount-nfs.plist\nsudo chmod 644 /Library/LaunchDaemons/com.user.mount-nfs.plist\n\n# 3. 加载并测试\nsudo launchctl load /Library/LaunchDaemons/com.user.mount-nfs.plist\nsudo launchctl start com.user.mount-nfs\n\n# 4. 检查结果\ncat /tmp/mount-nfs.err\nls ~/linux-share\n```\n\n---\n\n**配置说明：**\n\n| 位置 | 用途 |\n|------|------|\n| `/Users/ciss-ai/scripts/mount-nfs.sh` | 挂载脚本 |\n| `/Library/LaunchDaemons/com.user.mount-nfs.plist` | 系统服务配置（root 权限） |\n| `/tmp/mount-nfs.out` | 输出日志 |\n| `/tmp/mount-nfs.err` | 错误日志 |\n\n需要我帮你检查其他配置吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":385,"output":344,"cacheRead":42880,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43609,"cost":{"input":0.000385,"output":0.0011008,"cacheRead":0.008576,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.010061800000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772022438949}}
