{"type":"message","id":"7be1997c","parentId":"a62a46c5","timestamp":"2026-02-25T12:30:37.786Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"NFS 挂载成功！目录可以正常读写。让我更新一下脚本，避免重复挂载的错误，然后确认开机自动挂载配置。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"让我优化脚本，避免重复挂载错误："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f1a9601caf3141bdac9993b2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat > ~/scripts/mount-nfs.sh << 'EOF'\n#!/bin/bash\n# NFS 挂载脚本\n\nMOUNT_POINT=\"/Users/ciss-ai/linux-share\"\nNFS_SERVER=\"10.0.0.2:/home/dgx/shared\"\n\n# 检查是否已挂载\nif /sbin/mount | grep -q \"on $MOUNT_POINT \"; then\n    echo \"NFS already mounted on $MOUNT_POINT\"\n    exit 0\nfi\n\n# 创建挂载点\nmkdir -p \"$MOUNT_POINT\"\n\n# 挂载 NFS\nmount -t nfs -o resvport,rw,noatime \"$NFS_SERVER\" \"$MOUNT_POINT\"\n\nif [ $? -eq 0 ]; then\n    echo \"NFS mounted successfully: $NFS_SERVER -> $MOUNT_POINT\"\nelse\n    echo \"Failed to mount NFS: $NFS_SERVER\"\n    exit 1\nfi\nEOF\nchmod +x ~/scripts/mount-nfs.sh\necho \"脚本已更新\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":375,"output":268,"cacheRead":44160,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44803,"cost":{"input":0.000375,"output":0.0008576,"cacheRead":0.008832000000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.010064600000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772022617061}}
