{"type":"message","id":"51d1f61f","parentId":"8e9a9d64","timestamp":"2026-02-25T12:30:54.492Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ec71b352a25b45c584fa04be","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== LaunchDaemon 配置 ===\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC \"-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN\" \"http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd\">\n<plist version=\"1.0\">\n<dict>\n    <key>Label</key>\n    <string>com.user.mount-nfs</string>\n    <key>ProgramArguments</key>\n    <array>\n        <string>/Users/ciss-ai/scripts/mount-nfs.sh</string>\n    </array>\n    <key>RunAtLoad</key>\n    <true/>\n    <key>StandardOutPath</key>\n    <string>/tmp/mount-nfs.out</string>\n    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>\n    <string>/tmp/mount-nfs.err</string>\n</dict>\n</plist>\n\n=== 挂载脚本 ===\n#!/bin/bash\n# NFS 挂载脚本\n\nMOUNT_POINT=\"/Users/ciss-ai/linux-share\"\nNFS_SERVER=\"10.0.0.2:/home/dgx/shared\"\n\n# 检查是否已挂载\nif /sbin/mount | grep -q \"on $MOUNT_POINT \"; then\n    echo \"NFS already mounted on $MOUNT_POINT\"\n    exit 0\nfi\n\n# 创建挂载点\nmkdir -p \"$MOUNT_POINT\"\n\n# 挂载 NFS\nmount -t nfs -o resvport,rw,noatime \"$NFS_SERVER\" \"$MOUNT_POINT\"\n\nif [ $? -eq 0 ]; then\n    echo \"NFS mounted successfully: $NFS_SERVER -> $MOUNT_POINT\"\nelse\n    echo \"Failed to mount NFS: $NFS_SERVER\"\n    exit 1\nfi\n\n=== 当前挂载状态 ===\n10.0.0.2:/home/dgx/shared on /Users/ciss-ai/linux-share (nfs)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":27,"aggregated":"=== LaunchDaemon 配置 ===\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC \"-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN\" \"http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd\">\n<plist version=\"1.0\">\n<dict>\n    <key>Label</key>\n    <string>com.user.mount-nfs</string>\n    <key>ProgramArguments</key>\n    <array>\n        <string>/Users/ciss-ai/scripts/mount-nfs.sh</string>\n    </array>\n    <key>RunAtLoad</key>\n    <true/>\n    <key>StandardOutPath</key>\n    <string>/tmp/mount-nfs.out</string>\n    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>\n    <string>/tmp/mount-nfs.err</string>\n</dict>\n</plist>\n\n=== 挂载脚本 ===\n#!/bin/bash\n# NFS 挂载脚本\n\nMOUNT_POINT=\"/Users/ciss-ai/linux-share\"\nNFS_SERVER=\"10.0.0.2:/home/dgx/shared\"\n\n# 检查是否已挂载\nif /sbin/mount | grep -q \"on $MOUNT_POINT \"; then\n    echo \"NFS already mounted on $MOUNT_POINT\"\n    exit 0\nfi\n\n# 创建挂载点\nmkdir -p \"$MOUNT_POINT\"\n\n# 挂载 NFS\nmount -t nfs -o resvport,rw,noatime \"$NFS_SERVER\" \"$MOUNT_POINT\"\n\nif [ $? -eq 0 ]; then\n    echo \"NFS mounted successfully: $NFS_SERVER -> $MOUNT_POINT\"\nelse\n    echo \"Failed to mount NFS: $NFS_SERVER\"\n    exit 1\nfi\n\n=== 当前挂载状态 ===\n10.0.0.2:/home/dgx/shared on /Users/ciss-ai/linux-share (nfs)","cwd":"/Users/ciss-ai/.openclaw/agents/pm"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772022654488}}
{"type":"message","id":"fee08428","parentId":"51d1f61f","timestamp":"2026-02-25T12:31:08.629Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"完美！配置已经完成。让我给用户一个总结。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## ✅ NFS 自动挂载配置完成\n\n| 配置项 | 状态 |\n|--------|------|\n| 挂载脚本 | `~/scripts/mount-nfs.sh` ✅ |\n| LaunchDaemon | `/Library/LaunchDaemons/com.user.mount-nfs.plist` ✅ |\n| 当前挂载 | `10.0.0.2:/home/dgx/shared` → `~/linux-share` ✅ |\n\n**功能：**\n- 🔄 **开机自动挂载** - 系统启动时自动执行\n- 🛡️ **防重复挂载** - 脚本会检查是否已挂载\n- 📝 **日志记录** - 输出到 `/tmp/mount-nfs.out` 和 `/tmp/mount-nfs.err`\n\n**测试方法：**\n```bash\n# 手动触发挂载\nsudo launchctl start com.user.mount-nfs\n\n# 查看状态\nmount | grep nfs\nls ~/linux-share\n```\n\n配置完成！重启后也会自动挂载。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":528,"output":231,"cacheRead":44800,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45559,"cost":{"input":0.0005279999999999999,"output":0.0007392000000000001,"cacheRead":0.008960000000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0102272}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772022654492}}
