{"type":"message","id":"ced69bdb","parentId":"9d5cc47c","timestamp":"2026-02-25T12:59:18.236Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"找到问题了：\n- Linux 文件的 UID 是 1000\n- Mac 用户 ciss-ai 的 UID 是 501\n\nNFS 挂载时，UID 不匹配会导致权限问题。需要在 NFS 挂载选项中添加 `maproot` 或者在 Linux 服务器端配置 `no_root_squash` 和用户映射。\n\n让我检查一下哪些文件有权限问题。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"问题找到了！\n\n| 项目 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| Linux 文件所有者 | UID **1000** |\n| Mac 用户 ciss-ai | UID **501** |\n\n**UID 不匹配导致权限问题。**"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_81daf6c32732473cb20dc563","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 检查哪些文件无读取权限\nls -la ~/linux-share/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B/ | grep -E \"^-[-r][-w][-x][-r][-w][-x][-r][-w][-x]\" | awk '{print $1, $NF}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":299,"output":207,"cacheRead":46272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46778,"cost":{"input":0.000299,"output":0.0006624000000000001,"cacheRead":0.009254400000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0102158}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772024344160}}
