{"type":"message","id":"0bec9a18","parentId":"87ebcf5f","timestamp":"2026-02-25T12:59:29.706Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我发现问题了：\n- `.msc` 文件权限是 `-rw-------` (600)，只有所有者可读写\n- 其他文件都是 `-rw-rw-r--` (664)，应该是可读的\n\n但 UID 1000 和 UID 501 不匹配，NFS 默认会把文件所有者显示为 \"1000\" 而不是 \"ciss-ai\"。如果 NFS 服务器没有正确配置用户映射，Mac 端就无法访问。\n\n解决方案：\n1. 在 Linux 端修改 /etc/exports，添加 `map_static` 或 `all_squash` + `anonuid/anongid`\n2. 或者在 Mac 端修改挂载选项\n\n让我先检查当前用户能否读取这些文件。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5671238b7cb04010acb941e2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 尝试读取文件\nhead -1 ~/linux-share/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B/config.json 2>&1"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_df0df0f61cae4c659c16cd89","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 检查隐藏目录\nls -la ~/linux-share/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B/._____temp/ 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":721,"output":238,"cacheRead":46528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47487,"cost":{"input":0.000721,"output":0.0007616000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0093056,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.010788200000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772024358286}}
