{"type":"message","id":"a6c05229","parentId":"645ee586","timestamp":"2026-02-25T12:59:44.240Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"实际上文件是可以读取的。问题可能是在 Finder 中复制时遇到的问题，或者特定文件有问题。\n\n让我检查一下：\n1. 是否有只读文件\n2. 总文件数\n3. 尝试用命令行复制","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bcb2adfe30d4431a8d258f5f","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 统计文件和目录\necho \"=== 文件统计 ===\"\nfind ~/linux-share/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B -type f | wc -l\necho \"总文件数\"\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 总大小 ===\"\ndu -sh ~/linux-share/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 无读取权限的文件 ===\"\nfind ~/linux-share/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B -type f -perm +0000 -exec ls -la {} \\; 2>/dev/null | head -5\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 检查 .msc 文件 (权限 600) ===\"\ncat ~/linux-share/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B/.msc 2>&1 | head -3"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":324,"output":229,"cacheRead":47232,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47785,"cost":{"input":0.00032399999999999996,"output":0.0007328,"cacheRead":0.0094464,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0105032}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772024369756}}
{"type":"message","id":"b767d13f","parentId":"a6c05229","timestamp":"2026-02-25T12:59:44.293Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_bcb2adfe30d4431a8d258f5f","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 文件统计 ===\n      29\n总文件数\n\n=== 总大小 ===\n 67G\t/Users/ciss-ai/linux-share/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B\n\n=== 无读取权限的文件 ===\n\n=== 检查 .msc 文件 (权限 600) ===\ncat: /Users/ciss-ai/linux-share/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B/.msc: Permission denied"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":41,"aggregated":"=== 文件统计 ===\n      29\n总文件数\n\n=== 总大小 ===\n 67G\t/Users/ciss-ai/linux-share/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B\n\n=== 无读取权限的文件 ===\n\n=== 检查 .msc 文件 (权限 600) ===\ncat: /Users/ciss-ai/linux-share/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B/.msc: Permission denied","cwd":"/Users/ciss-ai/.openclaw/agents/pm"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772024384290}}
{"type":"message","id":"1c2d1172","parentId":"b767d13f","timestamp":"2026-02-25T12:59:58.009Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"找到问题了！`.msc` 文件权限是 600 (只有所有者可读写)，UID 1000 才能访问，但 Mac 用户是 UID 501。\n\n这应该是 Linux 端创建文件时的权限问题。需要在 Linux 端修改文件权限，或者配置 NFS 的用户映射。\n\n解决方案：\n1. 在 Linux 端修改 `.msc` 文件权限为 644\n2. 或者配置 NFS 服务器端的用户映射","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到问题了！\n\n**`.msc` 文件权限是 `600`（只有所有者可读写），导致无法读取。**\n\n## 解决方案\n\n需要在 **Linux 端**修改权限：\n\n```bash\n# 在 Linux 服务器 (10.0.0.2) 上执行\nchmod 644 /home/dgx/shared/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B/.msc\n\n# 或者修复整个目录的权限\nchmod -R a+r /home/dgx/shared/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B/\n```\n\n---\n\n**问题原因：**\n| 文件 | 权限 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `.msc` | `-rw-------` (600) | ❌ 无法读取 |\n| 其他文件 | `-rw-rw-r--` (664) | ✅ 可读取 |\n\n你能登录 Linux 服务器执行权限修改吗？或者告诉我 Linux 端的用户名，我可以生成完整的命令。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":331,"output":305,"cacheRead":47552,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48188,"cost":{"input":0.00033099999999999997,"output":0.0009760000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0095104,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.010817400000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772024384293}}
