{"type":"message","id":"d5dee13b","parentId":"e20a4a0b","timestamp":"2026-02-25T13:01:54.042Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户说 Linux 端的用户名是 dgx。我需要生成在 Linux 服务器上执行的命令来修复权限问题。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"请在 Linux 服务器 (10.0.0.2) 上执行以下命令：\n\n```bash\n# SSH 登录到 Linux 服务器\nssh dgx@10.0.0.2\n\n# 修复权限\nchmod 644 /home/dgx/shared/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B/.msc\n\n# 或者一次性修复整个目录（推荐）\nchmod -R a+rX /home/dgx/shared/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B/\n```\n\n---\n\n**或者从 Mac 远程执行：**"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_886271ef797c4bfab7f9ed12","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 尝试 SSH 到 Linux 修复权限\nssh dgx@10.0.0.2 \"chmod 644 /home/dgx/shared/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B/.msc && chmod -R a+rX /home/dgx/shared/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B/\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":2455,"output":227,"cacheRead":45312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47994,"cost":{"input":0.0024549999999999997,"output":0.0007264000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0090624,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.012243799999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772024498114}}
