{"type":"message","id":"78608848","parentId":"79a19336","timestamp":"2026-02-25T13:02:09.677Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"SSH 连接失败，可能是第一次连接需要验证 host key。我需要先生成命令让用户手动执行。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"SSH 需要首次验证。请在终端执行：\n\n```bash\n# 登录 Linux 服务器\nssh dgx@10.0.0.2\n\n# 输入 yes 确认 host key，然后输入密码\n\n# 登录后执行：\nchmod 644 /home/dgx/shared/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B/.msc\nchmod -R a+rX /home/dgx/shared/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B/\n\n# 验证\nls -la /home/dgx/shared/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B/.msc\n\n# 退出\nexit\n```\n\n完成后告诉我，我帮你验证 Mac 端是否可以正常访问。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":266,"output":181,"cacheRead":47744,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48191,"cost":{"input":0.000266,"output":0.0005792000000000001,"cacheRead":0.009548800000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.010394000000000002}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772024514115}}
