{"type":"message","id":"32b6b77d","parentId":"82623e12","timestamp":"2026-02-25T13:20:58.194Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"GLM-5 需要 API key，但环境变量中没有。让我修改测试脚本，只测试 LM Studio 中的模型，或者让用户知道需要配置 API key。\n\n实际上，LM Studio 中也有 `zai-org/glm-4.7-flash`，这应该是通过某种方式代理的。让我检查一下是否可以直接通过 LM Studio API 访问。\n\n先简化测试，只对比 LM Studio 中的 Qwen3.5 和一个本地可用的模型。或者我可以询问用户是否有 API key。\n\n让我先尝试直接测试 LM Studio 中的两个模型：qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b 和 zai-org/glm-4.7-flash（如果 LM Studio 能代理的话）。\n\n不对，我应该检查一下用户实际能访问的模型。让我修改脚本，只测试 LM Studio 中可用的模型。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"需要确认 GLM-5 的访问方式。让我检查并更新测试脚本："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f5ec3427a6da4d7da68b99d6","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 测试 LM Studio 中的模型是否都能访问\ncurl -s http://localhost:1234/v1/chat/completions \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"model\": \"qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b\", \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"1+1=?\"}], \"max_tokens\": 10}' | jq -r '.choices[0].message.content // .error // \"unknown error\"'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":228,"output":307,"cacheRead":55488,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56023,"cost":{"input":0.00022799999999999999,"output":0.0009824,"cacheRead":0.0110976,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.012308000000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772025643336}}
